# OSPFv2 wire decode: public Link State Update capture
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-2-wire Story 5 -- `ze ospf decode` parses a real OSPF
#            LS Update payload, iterates its 41 LSA list, renders Summary-LSAs,
#            and verifies packet/LSA checksums.
# PREVENTS: Length-driven LSA iteration, Summary-LSA decoding, or Fletcher
#           verification drifting from the offline decode command.
# Source: Wireshark issue attachment "ospf-ls-update-with-41-lsas.pcap".
stdin=payload:
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze ospf decode:stdin=payload
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains="type":"ls-update"
expect=stdout:contains="router-id":"192.168.1.121"
expect=stdout:contains="checksum-valid":true
expect=stdout:contains="type":"summary-network"
expect=stdout:contains="link-state-id":"10.32.1.88"
expect=stdout:contains="advertising-router":"192.168.1.120"
expect=stdout:contains="metric":4
